                                "sense_id": "a5acaa16-0af0-391d-adf1-179f98cf7f1c",
                                "text": "You can cook naan in a normal oven, but the results will inevitably disappoint; even Indians generally wait to savour them in restaurants, as very few homes are equipped with a tandoor."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
